# The project ships no man page, so this package has none. docs/CLI.md and
# docs/CONFIGURATION.md are installed under /usr/share/doc/ananicy-rs/docs/
# instead, and README.Debian says where they are. Writing a man page inside the
# packaging would create a second copy of the command-line reference to keep in
# step with the binary; it belongs upstream, next to the code it documents, and
# that is a change to propose rather than one to smuggle in via a recipe.
no-manual-page

# Expected for a package that has never been uploaded: there is no bug to close
# on the initial upload. It goes away by itself once there is an upload behind
# this one.
initial-upload-closes-no-bugs
